gy.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0027 +\\n                            \\u0027\\u003cli\\u003ePerfect for achieving better poses and maintaining focus with its \\u003cspan class\\u003d\\\"highlight\\\"\\u003enon-slip surface\\u003c/span\\u003e.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u0027 +\\n                        \\u0027\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u0027;\\n        var originalContent \\u003d descriptionContainer.innerHTML;\\n        descriptionContainer.innerHTML \\u003d narrative + originalContent;\\n    }\\n});\\n\"],\"updated\":false},\"nodePath\":[\"Top\",\"Companies\",\"www.yogadirect.com\",\"Rules\",\"example.com\",\"example.com\",\"Mod Yoga Direct 1 4 Inch Yoga Mat Script (1)\"]}"}
