e materials, this mat cares for your health and the planet. Lightweight and portable, it\\u0027s designed for yogis on the go.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n                \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eVersatile and Stylish:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Available in a range of vibrant colors to match your personal style. Enjoy exclusive bulk pricing options and the ability to custom print your own designs for a truly personalized yoga experience.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n            \\u003c/div\\u003e\\n        `;\\n    }\\n});\\n{\\n  var styleSheet \\u003d document.createElement(\\\"style\\\");\\n  styleSheet.textContent \\u003d \\u0027.enhanced-description {\\\\n    font-size: 14pt;\\\\n    font-family: \\\\\\u0027Georgia\\\\\\u0027, serif;\\\\n    color: #2e2e2e;\\\\n    line-height: 1.6;\\\\n    margin-top: 20px;\\\\n}\\u0027;\\n  document.head.appendChild(styleSheet);\\n}\\n{\\n  var styleSheet \\u003d document.createElement(\\\"style\\\");\\n  styleSheet.textContent \\u003d \\u0027.enhanced-description strong {\\\\n    color: #3a6ea5;\\\\n    font-weight: 700;\\\\n}\\u0027;\\n  document.head.appendChild(styleSheet);\\n}\"],\"updated\":false},\"nodePath\":[\"Top\",\"Companies\",\"www.yogadirect.com\",\"Rules\",\"example.com\",\"example.com\",\"Mod The Current Description Lacks A Compelling Narrative That Script\"]}"}
