{"source":"WebSockets","type":"add","time":"2025-01-28T21:42:29.458872Z","top":"Top","group":"Companies","company":"www.yogadirect.com","location":"rules","division":"example.com","site":"example.com","name":"Mod By Enriching The Product Description With Storytelling Script","info":"{\"tooltip\":\"Script modification\",\"type\":\"mod\",\"children\":[],\"details\":{\"name\":\"Mod By Enriching The Product Description With Storytelling Script\",\"extra\":\"\",\"enabled\":true,\"type\":\"script\",\"created\":\"2025-01-28T21:39:11.638Z\",\"lastmodified\":\"2025-01-28T21:39:11.638Z\",\"pathvalue\":\"/yoga-direct-1-4-inch-yoga-mat.html\",\"comments\":\"\",\"prob\":100.0,\"usemode\":\"test\",\"cssselector\":\"\",\"xpath\":\"\",\"find\":[],\"nodeiden\":{\"type\":\"tag\",\"attributes\":{\"tag\":\"head\"},\"counts\":{\"tag\":1},\"parent\":{\"tag\":\"html\"}},\"parameter\":0,\"scripts\":[\"document.addEventListener(\\u0027DOMContentLoaded\\u0027, function() {\\n    var productDetailsTab \\u003d document.querySelector(\\u0027#tab-6 .info\\u0027);\\n    if (productDetailsTab) {\\n        var storytellingContent \\u003d document.createElement(\\u0027div\\u0027);\\n        storytellingContent.className \\u003d \\u0027storytelling\\u0027;\\n        storytellingContent.innerHTML \\u003d \\\"\\u003cp\\u003eImagine a yoga mat that not only serves its purpose of cushioning and stability but also tells a story. Our 1/4 Inch Yoga Mat is crafted with love, designed for both seasoned yogis and newcomers to the practice. Picture yourself gracefully moving on a mat that\\u0027s been a silent witness to countless sun salutations and calming meditative practices, providing the perfect foundation for your mindfulness journey.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEach mat carries the essence of what Yoga Direct stands for — a commitment to quality and sustainability. With its rich color options, this mat reflects the beauty found in diversity and the personal stories of every yogi who uses it. Let it su