{"source":"WebSockets","type":"add","time":"2025-03-05T18:24:38.118533100Z","top":"Top","group":"Companies","company":"www.yogadirect.com","location":"rules","division":"example.com","site":"example.com","name":"Mod Compelling Storytelling Helps Users Connect Emotionally Script","info":"{\"tooltip\":\"Script modification\",\"type\":\"mod\",\"children\":[],\"details\":{\"name\":\"Mod Compelling Storytelling Helps Users Connect Emotionally Script\",\"extra\":\"\",\"enabled\":true,\"type\":\"script\",\"created\":\"2025-03-05T18:24:25.312Z\",\"lastmodified\":\"2025-03-05T18:24:25.312Z\",\"pathvalue\":\"/yoga-direct-1-4-inch-yoga-mat.html\",\"comments\":\"\",\"prob\":100.0,\"usemode\":\"test\",\"cssselector\":\"\",\"xpath\":\"\",\"find\":[],\"nodeiden\":{\"type\":\"tag\",\"attributes\":{\"tag\":\"head\"},\"counts\":{\"tag\":1},\"parent\":{\"tag\":\"html\"}},\"parameter\":0,\"scripts\":[\"  document.addEventListener(\\u0027DOMContentLoaded\\u0027, function() {\\n    var newDescription \\u003d `\\n      \\u003cp style\\u003d\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \\u0027Lucida Unicode\\u0027, sans-serif; color: #000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\\u003e\\n        Discover the path to tranquility with our 1/4 Inch Yoga Mat. Designed for both the yoga novice and the devoted practitioner, our mat is more than just a surface — it\\u0027s your personal sanctuary. Elevate your practice with the perfect blend of support and cushioning, enabling you to achieve the poses you\\u0027ve always aspired to master with ease and comfort.\\n      \\u003c/p\\u003e\\n      \\u003cp style\\u003d\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \\u0027Lucida Unicode\\u0027, sans-serif; color: #000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\\u003e\\n        Feel the unrivaled grip and embrace your focus as you glide through each session, whether at home or in the studio. With a palette of colors to align with your mood and intent, our mat becomes an extension of your yoga journey, helping you to transform your day from ordinary to extraordinary.\\n      \\u003c/p\\u003e\\n      \\u003cp style\\u003d\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \\u0027Lucida Unicode\\u0027, sans-serif; color: #000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\\u003e\\n        Find your peace on our mat and let its stability ground you, while you explore the serenity and strength within.\\n      \\u003c/p\\u003e\\n    `;\\n    var descriptionElement \\u003d document.querySelector(\\u0027#tab-1 .item[itemprop\\u003d\\\"description\\\"]\\u0027);\\n    if (descriptionElement) {\\n      descriptionElement.innerHTML \\u003d newDescription;\\n    }\\n  });\"],\"updated\":false},\"nodePath\":[\"Top\",\"Companies\",\"www.yogadirect.com\",\"Rules\",\"example.com\",\"example.com\",\"Mod Compelling Storytelling Helps Users Connect Emotionally Script\"]}"}
{"source":"WebSockets","type":"add","time":"2025-03-05T18:24:38.217556800Z","top":"Top","group":"Companies","company":"www.yogadirect.com","location":"rules","division":"example.com","site":"example.com","name":"Mod Users Often Have Short Attention Spans And Are More Likely Script","info":"{\"tooltip\":\"Script modification\",\"type\":\"mod\",\"children\":[],\"details\":{\"name\":\"Mod Users Often Have Short Attention Spans And Are More Likely Script\",\"extra\":\"\",\"enabled\":true,\"type\":\"script\",\"created\":\"2025-03-05T18:24:25.318Z\",\"lastmodified\":\"2025-03-05T18:24:25.318Z\",\"pathvalue\":\"/yoga-direct-1-4-inch-yoga-mat.html\",\"comments\":\"\",\"prob\":100.0,\"usemode\":\"test\",\"cssselector\":\"\",\"xpath\":\"\",\"find\":[],\"nodeiden\":{\"type\":\"tag\",\"attributes\":{\"tag\":\"head\"},\"counts\":{\"tag\":1},\"parent\":{\"tag\":\"html\"}},\"parameter\":0,\"scripts\":[\"document.addEventListener(\\u0027DOMContentLoaded\\u0027, function() {\\n  var headers \\u003d document.querySelectorAll(\\u0027.tab-toggle\\u0027);\\n  headers.forEach(function(header) {\\n    header.addEventListener(\\u0027click\\u0027, function() {\\n      var content \\u003d header.nextElementSibling;\\n      var isActive \\u003d header.classList.toggle(\\u0027active\\u0027);\\n      if (isActive) {\\n        content.style.display \\u003d \\u0027block\\u0027;\\n      } else {\\n        content.style.display \\u003d \\u0027none\\u0027;\\n      }\\n    });\\n  });\\n});\\n\\nwindow.addEventListener(\\u0027load\\u0027, function() {\\n  var description \\u003d document.querySelector(\\u0027#tab-1\\u0027);\\n  var reviews \\u003d document.querySelector(\\u0027#createreview-modal\\u0027);\\n  var tabsDiv \\u003d document.querySelector(\\u0027#rTabs\\u0027);\\n  var container \\u003d document.querySelector(\\u0027.product-cols\\u0027);\\n  if (description \\u0026\\u0026 container \\u0026\\u0026 tabsDiv) {\\n    container.insertAdjacentElement(\\u0027afterend\\u0027, description);\\n  }\\n  if (reviews \\u0026\\u0026 container \\u0026\\u0026 tabsDiv) {\\n    container.insertAdjacentElement(\\u0027afterend\\u0027, reviews);\\n  }\\n\\n  var detailsTab \\u003d tabsDiv.querySelector(\\u0027li:nth-child(2)\\u0027);\\n  if (detailsTab) {\\n    var detailsSection \\u003d document.createElement(\\u0027div\\u0027);\\n    detailsSection.className \\u003d \\u0027tabs-collapse\\u0027;\\n    detailsSection.innerHTML \\u003d \\u0027\\u003cdiv class\\u003d\\\"tab-toggle\\\"\\u003eProduct Details\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u0027 + detailsTab.nextElementSibling.outerHTML;\\n    detailsTab.nextElementSibling.remove();\\n    detailsTab.insertAdjacentElement(\\u0027afterend\\u0027, detailsSection);\\n    detailsSection.querySelector(\\u0027.tab-content\\u0027).style.display \\u003d \\u0027none\\u0027;\\n  }\\n\\n  var warrantyTab \\u003d tabsDiv.querySelector(\\u0027li:nth-child(4)\\u0027);\\n  if (warrantyTab) {\\n    var warrantySection \\u003d document.createElement(\\u0027div\\u0027);\\n    warrantySection.className \\u003d \\u0027tabs-collapse\\u0027;\\n    warrantySection.innerHTML \\u003d \\u0027\\u003cdiv class\\u003d\\\"tab-toggle\\\"\\u003eWarranty\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u0027 + warrantyTab.nextElementSibling.outerHTML;\\n    warrantyTab.nextElementSibling.remove();\\n    warrantyTab.insertAdjacentElement(\\u0027afterend\\u0027, warrantySection);\\n    warrantySection.querySelector(\\u0027.tab-content\\u0027).style.display \\u003d \\u0027none\\u0027;\\n  }\\n});\\n{\\n  var styleSheet \\u003d document.createElement(\\\"style\\\");\\n  styleSheet.textContent \\u003d \\u0027.tabs-collapse .tab-content { display: none; }\\u0027;\\n  document.head.appendChild(styleSheet);\\n}\\n{\\n  var styleSheet \\u003d document.createElement(\\\"style\\\");\\n  styleSheet.textContent \\u003d \\u0027.tabs-collapse .tab-header.active + .tab-content { display: block; }\\u0027;\\n  document.head.appendChild(styleSheet);\\n}\\n{\\n  var styleSheet \\u003d document.createElement(\\\"style\