{"source":"web","type":"delete","time":"2025-08-03T20:50:47.689567200Z","top":"Top","group":"Companies","company":"www.yogadirect.com","location":"rules","division":"example.com","site":"example.com","name":"Mod Storytelling Helps In Creating An Emotional Connection Script","info":"{\"tooltip\":\"Script modification\",\"type\":\"mod\",\"details\":{\"name\":\"Mod Storytelling Helps In Creating An Emotional Connection Script\",\"extra\":\"\",\"enabled\":true,\"type\":\"script\",\"created\":\"2025-02-10T18:21:46.206Z\",\"lastmodified\":\"2025-02-10T18:21:46.206Z\",\"find\":[],\"xpath\":\"\",\"pathre\":false,\"scripts\":[\"document.addEventListener(\\u0027DOMContentLoaded\\u0027, function() {var narrative \\u003d `\\u003cdiv id\\u003d\\u0027product-narrative\\u0027\\u003e \\u003ch2\\u003eExperience the Ultimate Yoga Journey\\u003c/h2\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eEmbrace your wellness journey with our 1/4 Inch Yoga Mat, crafted to support every twist, turn, and pose. Imagine starting your day with a serene yoga session, where your mat acts as a supportive foundation, enhancing every moment of your practice.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eMore than just an exercise accessory, this mat is designed with durability and sustainability in mind?free from harmful chemicals and allergens, supporting a healthier planet and a healthier you.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eWhether you\\u0027re at home, in the park, or at a yoga studio, our mat\\u0027s superior grip and comfort will elevate your practice, making each session a stepping stone towards an improved lifestyle.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e`;var testimonials \\u003d `\\u003cdiv id\\u003d\\u0027customer-testimonials\\u0027\\u003e \\u003ch3\\u003eWhat Our Customers Are Saying\\u003c/h3\\u003e \\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\\"I\\u0027ve tried many yoga mats, but this one is by far the best. It\\u0027s incredibly comfortable and has helped me take my practice to the next level.\\\" - Lisa M.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/blockq