{"source":"WebSockets","type":"add","time":"2025-10-30T03:25:23.585526600Z","top":"Top","group":"Companies","company":"www.yogadirect.com","location":"rules","division":"example.com","site":"example.com","name":"Mod Rewriting Product Descriptions To Focus Not Just On Features Script","info":"{\"tooltip\":\"Script modification\",\"type\":\"mod\",\"children\":[],\"details\":{\"name\":\"Mod Rewriting Product Descriptions To Focus Not Just On Features Script\",\"extra\":\"\",\"type\":\"script\",\"created\":\"2025-10-30T03:25:23.425Z\",\"lastmodified\":\"2025-10-30T03:25:23.425Z\",\"pathvalue\":\"/\",\"comments\":\"\",\"probability\":100,\"usemode\":\"off\",\"cssselector\":\"\",\"xpath\":\"\",\"find\":[],\"nodeiden\":{\"type\":\"tag\",\"attributes\":{\"tag\":\"head\"},\"counts\":{\"tag\":1},\"parent\":{\"tag\":\"html\"}},\"parameter\":0,\"scripts\":[\"document.addEventListener(\\u0027DOMContentLoaded\\u0027, function() {\\n  const productElements \\u003d document.querySelectorAll(\\u0027.product-item\\u0027);\\n  const stories \\u003d {\\n    \\u0027YP41MATXXX14\\u0027: \\u0027Discover the perfect companion for your yoga journey with our 1/4 Inch Yoga Mat by Yoga Direct. Crafted for those who desire excellent cushioning during their poses.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP41MATXXX18\\u0027: \\u0027Our 1/8 Inch Yoga Mat is your go-to for an authentic and lightweight yoga experience, ideal for those on the move.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP41ABLXXX65\\u0027: \\u0027Bounce into action! These 55-65cm anti-burst yoga balls are designed to provide fun, stability, and engagement during physical activities.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP41STRXXX08\\u0027: \\u0027Secure your yoga poses with the reliable 8 Ft Cinch Buckle Yoga Strap, perfect for deep stretches and mastering alignment.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP42STRXXXD8\\u0027: \\u0027Find your flexibility with our 8 Ft D-Ring Yoga Strap, designed to help you achieve deeper poses with ease.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP50GCDXXX01\\u0027: \\u0027Gift flexibility and relaxation with our YogaDirect E-Gift Cards, the perfect treat for any yoga enthusiast.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP41MATXXXEL\\u0027: \\u0027Our Extra Long Yoga Mat offers you the expansive space to stretch freely while ensuring comfort in every pose.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP41BLKXXX4L\\u0027: \\u0027Enhance your practice with this Foam Yoga Block, a versatile prop to support your progress whether you’re a beginner or a seasoned yogi.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP41MATXXXKD\\u0027: \\u0027Introducing joy in practice with our Fun Yoga Mat For Kids, crafted to inspire the younger generation.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP42MEXXXX01\\u0027: \\u0027Wrap yourself in tradition and warmth with our Handmade Traditional Mexican Yoga Blanket – a beautiful blend of style and comfort.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP41MATXXXPW\\u0027: \\u0027Experience premium support with our Premium Weight Yoga Mat, tailored for yogis who appreciate greater stability.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP42EYEXXXCU\\u0027: \\u0027Relax deeper into your savasana with our Small Cotton Eye Pillow, perfect for unwinding after practice.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP42MEXXXX03\\u0027: \\u0027Bring vibrant color and classic style into your space with our Solid Color Mexican Yoga Blanket, the ideal companion for relaxation.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP42BOLXXX03\\u0027: \\u0027Achieve the perfect posture with our Supportive Rectangular Cotton Yoga Bolster, offering core support for your restorative practices.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YP41MATNRXXX\\u0027: \\u0027Find your zen with our Textured Natural Rubber Yoga Mat, combining grip and comfort in perfect harmony.\\u0027,\\n    \\u0027YPJ6TOWXXXMF\\u0027: \\u0027Stay fresh and focused with our Yoga Mat Towel, designed to enhance your grip and maintain hygiene.\\u0027\\n  };\\n\\n  productElements.forEach(function(productElement) {\\n    const id \\u003d productElement.getAttribute(\\u0027data-catalogid\\u0027);\\n    const storyElement \\u003d document.createElement(\\u0027div\\u0027);\\n    storyElement.className \\u003d \\u0027product-story\\u0027;\\n    storyElement.textContent \\u003d stories[id] || \\u0027\\u0027;\\n    productElement.appendChild(storyElement);\\n  });\\n});\"],\"updated\":false},\"nodePath\":[\"Top\",\"Companies\",\"www.yogadirect.com\",\"Rules\",\"example.com\",\"example.com\",\"Mod Rewriting Product Descriptions To Focus Not Just On Features Script\"]}"}
